# Speed Cards starter deck: Spanish frequency lists. seed-version: 1
# Generated by tools/seed/frequency.py from frequencylists.blogspot.com; edit the script, not this file.
# Cards come up in list order. Both lists share the parent deck's daily limit, so studying
# "Frecuencia" works through the 1000 words before the first noun.
# A word repeated within a list is one note, at its first rank.

@deck Frecuencia::1 · 1000 palabras más usadas
@type Spanish Vocab
@tags frequency top1000
@languages es-MX en-US

id: seed-es-top1000-0001
Spanish: la
English: the, "third person direct object"
Example (ES): Compré una camisa nueva y {{c1::la}} quiero estrenar hoy.
Example (EN): I bought a new shirt and I want to wear it for the first time today.
Notes: #1 of the 1000 most used words

id: seed-es-top1000-0002
Spanish: el
English: the
Example (ES): {{c1::El}} camión pasa cada diez minutos.
Example (EN): The bus comes every ten minutes.
